    "body": "`hyperfine -w 10 -r 200 \"target/debug/starship prompt\" \"target/debug/starship-without-multi-exts prompt\"` says that there's about a 2% +/- 10% difference in runtime in a directory with 500 files in on this 'ere machine, although from one run to the next it can't tell whether it's faster with or without that `map`. IOW, it's too fast to measure and is lost in the noise.",
